---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
    title="線上遊戲 | 工程 × 生醫 × AI"
    description="免安裝的瀏覽器小遊戲合集：禁閉逃殺：文字獄 — 抽卡 RPG、回合制戰鬥、肉鴿遠征、網路對戰。"
    bodyPage="games"
    pageStyles={[]}
    pageScripts={[]}
    headInline=""
>
    <div data-site-nav></div>

    <div class="games-page">
        <header class="gp-hero">
            <div class="gp-kicker">PLAY IN BROWSER</div>
            <h1>🎮 線上遊戲</h1>
            <p class="gp-sub">
                純前端、免安裝、免登入就能玩。進度存在你自己的瀏覽器裡（localStorage），關掉再開也不會消失。
            </p>
        </header>

        <section class="gp-grid">
            <article class="gp-card">
                <a class="gp-cover" href="/games/confinement-escape/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="開始玩禁閉逃殺：文字獄">
                    <img
                        src="/games/confinement-escape/images/bosses/overlord_1.webp"
                        alt="禁閉逃殺：文字獄 魔王封面"
                        width="320"
                        height="320"
                        loading="lazy"
                    />
                    <span class="gp-play">▶ 立即開始</span>
                </a>
                <div class="gp-body">
                    <h2>禁閉逃殺：文字獄</h2>
                    <div class="gp-tags">
                        <span class="gp-tag hot">SSR 抽卡</span>
                        <span class="gp-tag">回合制戰鬥</span>
                        <span class="gp-tag">肉鴿遠征</span>
                        <span class="gp-tag">網路對戰</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="gp-desc">
                        從 B7 停屍間爬到 2F 停機坪的禁閉逃殺。抽職業卡、養裝備、練突破，一層一層往上爬，
                        躲毒氣、找物資、跟其他逃殺者結盟或背叛——但直升機只有三個座位。
                        12 章主線 + 無盡深淵，外加魔王討伐、競技場、練功房與養成賽。
                    </p>
                    <div class="gp-meta">
                        <span>⏱ 單局 10–30 分鐘</span>
                        <span>💾 進度自動存檔</span>
                        <span>📱 支援手機</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="gp-actions">
                        <a class="gp-btn primary" href="/games/confinement-escape/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">開始遊玩 ↗</a>
                        <a class="gp-btn ghost" href="/games/confinement-escape/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">新分頁開啟</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>
        </section>

        <section class="gp-note">
            <h3>關於這份收錄</h3>
            <ul>
                <li>《禁閉逃殺：文字獄》原作為 <strong>gagatim</strong> 的公開網頁遊戲，本頁為作者原始碼的鏡像收錄，版權與原作所有。</li>
                <li>背景音樂取自 <a href="https://opengameart.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">OpenGameArt</a>，授權 CC0；角色與魔王插圖為原作者自製。</li>
                <li>遊戲本身不需要後端：帳號／雲端存檔與網路對戰沿用原作的 Firebase 設定，不登入也完全玩得動。</li>
            </ul>
        </section>
    </div>

    <div data-site-footer></div>

    <style is:inline>
        .games-page {
            max-width: 1040px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 48px 20px 80px;
        }
        .gp-hero { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px; }
        .gp-kicker {
            font-size: 12px;
            letter-spacing: 6px;
            color: #8a94a0;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .gp-hero h1 {
            margin: 10px 0 12px;
            font-size: clamp(34px, 7vw, 56px);
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            background: linear-gradient(120deg, #e5484d 0%, #b07cff 55%, #4aa3ff 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;
        }
        .gp-sub {
            margin: 0 auto;
            max-width: 640px;
            color: #9aa4b2;
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.75;
        }
        .gp-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
        }
        .gp-card {
            background: linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(229, 72, 77, 0.08), rgba(20, 24, 30, 0.9) 45%);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);
            border-radius: 18px;
            overflow: hidden;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
        }
        .gp-card:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); border-color: rgba(229, 72, 77, 0.55); }
        .gp-cover {
            position: relative;
            display: block;
            aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 40%, #2a1013, #0c0e11 70%);
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .gp-cover img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: contain;
            opacity: 0.92;
            transition: transform 0.4s ease;
        }
        .gp-card:hover .gp-cover img { transform: scale(1.05); }
        .gp-play {
            position: absolute;
            left: 50%;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            padding: 10px 22px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: rgba(12, 14, 17, 0.78);
            border: 1px solid #e5484d;
            color: #fff;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 15px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
        }
        .gp-body { padding: 20px 22px 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; flex: 1; }
        .gp-body h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: 1px; }
        .gp-tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; }
        .gp-tag {
            font-size: 11px;
            padding: 2px 8px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
            color: #9aa4b2;
        }
        .gp-tag.hot { border-color: #f5c451; color: #f5c451; }
        .gp-desc { margin: 0; color: #aab3bf; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8; flex: 1; }
        .gp-meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; color: #7d8794; font-size: 12px; }
        .gp-actions { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 4px; }
        .gp-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 11px 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: none;
            border: 1px solid transparent;
            transition: background 0.18s ease, border-color 0.18s ease;
        }
        .gp-btn.primary { background: #4a1518; border-color: #e5484d; color: #fff; }
        .gp-btn.primary:hover { background: #62191d; }
        .gp-btn.ghost { background: transparent; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16); color: #aab3bf; }
        .gp-btn.ghost:hover { border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4); color: #e6edf3; }
        .gp-note {
            margin-top: 36px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 18px 22px;
            color: #8a94a0;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.85;
        }
        .gp-note h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; color: #c9ced5; font-size: 15px; }
        .gp-note ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; }
        .gp-note li { margin-bottom: 5px; }
        .gp-note a { color: #4aa3ff; }
        .gp-note strong { color: #c9ced5; }
    </style>
</Base>
